    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "archive",
        "lost and found",
        "ledger",
        "the stacks"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "The Lowmere Archive of Lost and Found",
      "content": "The Archive sits at the bottom of Gull Street. Inside it is larger than the building: shelves to the ceiling, ladders on brass rails, a reading table under a green lamp. Lost things from anywhere arrive here eventually: keys in the morning, letters with the fog, larger items through the cellar. Every item is logged in a ledger with date, shelf, condition, provenance and claimant. The bell over the door rings by itself when something important arrives. Wren Calloway is the keeper.",
