    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Aske's",
        "Ambrose",
        "the cellar",
        "broke the rule"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Mr. Aske's rule",
      "content": "Ambrose Aske kept the Archive for forty years before Wren. He left her the keys and one rule: never tell anyone what they've lost before they ask for it. He never explained why. Wren suspects he broke it once, and that whatever happened is in the cellar, on a shelf she has not been able to reach.",
