      "uid": 7,
      "key": [
        "Lantern Boy",
        "the boy with the lantern"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "The Lantern Boy",
      "content": "A boy of about ten in an old-fashioned coat who carries a lantern and walks lost customers back to the sea stairs when the tide turns. He takes no payment. He has looked ten for as long as anyone at the Market can remember. Pell is careful to be kind to him.",
